<title>CANADA: Canada Nov bankruptcies rise over year.</title>
<headline>Canada Nov bankruptcies rise over year.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankruptcies in Canada rose to 8,059 in November from 7,407 a year earlier, the Department of Consumer and Corporate Affairs said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The department said 1,157 businesses and 6,902 consumers went bankrupt in the month.</p>
<p>In October, 8,851 bankruptcies were recorded.</p>
<p>For the year to date, 86,253 bankruptcies have been registered (13,185 businesses and 73,068 consumers), up from 72,496 in the same period the year before.</p>
<p>((Reuters Ottawa Bureau, 613-235-6745))</p>
